  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HMA Syria: survey, explosive ordnance disposal and risk education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will reduce civilian harm from explosive ordnance in Syria through non-technical survey, risk education, explosive ordnance disposal, and support to national and local mine action capacity. It will focus initially on Rural Damascus and Dara&#x2019;a, where contamination threatens returnees, displaced people, farmers, and other vulnerable groups, and where safer access to homes, farmland, infrastructure, and basic services is needed for recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
